{
 "tickets": [
  {
   "body": "Hello, we noticed that some incoming electronic lab results from our main reference laboratory haven't been populating in our patient charts since yesterday morning, and we also want to make sure no confidential feeds were misrouted to another facility. Could someone please check our interface connection?",
   "id": "gen-311",
   "subject": "Missing lab feeds and connection check"
  },
  {
   "body": "Dear Support Team, I am writing to inquire about the standard protocol for routing abnormal incoming laboratory results to covering physicians for review and electronic sign-off. Please provide guidance at your earliest convenience.",
   "id": "gen-312",
   "subject": "Inquiry regarding lab sign-off and routing"
  },
  {
   "body": "We need to add a couple of local specialty pharmacies that our patients frequently use but which are missing from the system directory. Can you tell me how to manually create custom entries in the pharmacy database? Thanks.",
   "id": "gen-313",
   "subject": "Adding custom pharmacies to directory"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, we are having trouble querying the state prescription monitoring program through the usual medication history tab. Every time I select a patient and click to retrieve external fills, an error message pops up saying the service is unavailable. We need this working for our controlled substance checks. Please let me know what credentials or settings we need to verify.",
   "id": "gen-314",
   "subject": "External medication history query errors"
  },
  {
   "body": "This is ridiculous! I tried updating our credit card on the billing portal for our subscription invoice, and suddenly an error flashed on the screen showing another practice's payment profile and account details. This is a massive privacy breach and I am furious that financial and patient data is getting crossed. Fix this immediately and explain how this happened.",
   "id": "gen-315",
   "subject": "URGENT: Billing portal privacy breach / wrong data shown"
  },
  {
   "body": "Some of our denied insurance claims reports are showing patient PHI from outside our provider group. Please look into this data exposure right away.",
   "id": "gen-316",
   "subject": "Security concern in claims denial reporting"
  },
  {
   "body": "Need to move an appointment to a different provider slot for a patient, but the reschedule button is greyed out. Please advise.",
   "id": "gen-317",
   "subject": "Cannot reschedule appointment"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, we would like to enable online appointment booking for our patients through the web portal. Could you point us to the settings where we can restrict these bookings to specific visit types and providers?",
   "id": "gen-318",
   "subject": "Configuring online patient booking settings"
  },
  {
   "body": "I am so sorry to bother you while I have a full waiting room, but my patient portal password reset tool isn't sending out the verification emails. I have several patients standing at the front desk trying to log in for their telehealth visits. Could someone please help me unlock these accounts right now?",
   "id": "gen-319",
   "subject": "Portal password reset failing with patients waiting"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, we had an issue where a pharmacy renewal request for a patient was transmitted with the wrong dosage amount because the system defaulted to an old sig. We managed to call the pharmacy directly to correct it, but we need to know how to properly link and handle these renewals so it doesn't happen again.",
   "id": "gen-320",
   "subject": "Pharmacy renewal request error and dosage correction"
  }
 ]
}
